# Build artifacts
minzx
jase
*.o
*.d
tools/virtual_esp01/virtual_esp01
tools/fsrv/FSRV.COM
bin/Win32/
bin/x64/

# Windows-only vendored binaries from the original Visual Studio project —
# dead weight, we build on Linux via system SDL2 (pkg-config)
lib/SDL2/Win32/
lib/SDL2/x64/

# Copyrighted ROM images — not ours to distribute, keep local only.
# Case-sensitive filesystem, so both extensions are needed (found real
# *.ROM files under docs/ that the lowercase-only pattern silently missed).
*.rom
*.ROM

# Separately-sold font asset (Nimble Beasts Collective's mago1, used to
# generate src/OsdFont.h via tools/font/bake_mago_font.py) — not ours to
# distribute either, keep local only
mago1.ttf

# Recall plugin's auto-generated compaction context (populated by its
# PreCompact hook) — not meant to be committed
.claude/recall-context.md
